        <div class="pt-1"><span class="inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider bg-navy-950 text-white">The guardrail</span><p class="mt-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#374151]">It can only use components you have approved, with props a schema validates. It never writes markup, so your design system and permissions stay in charge.</p></div>
