      <span class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]"><span class="h-px w-8 bg-[#5a9100]"></span>How it works</span>
      <h2 id="gu-how-heading" class="text-[32px] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[42px]">The model never writes markup. It chooses from components you already own.</h2>
      <ol class="mt-8 space-y-0">
        <li class="flex gap-5 border-t border-navy-100 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#5a9100]">01</span><div><p class="text-[17px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Intent</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">The request arrives in natural language, from a prompt box or an assistant already inside your product.</p></div></li>
        <li class="flex gap-5 border-t border-navy-100 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#5a9100]">02</span><div><p class="text-[17px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Data</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">The system fetches what is asked for through your existing APIs, under the viewer&rsquo;s permissions, not the model&rsquo;s.</p></div></li>
        <li class="flex gap-5 border-t border-navy-100 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#5a9100]">03</span><div><p class="text-[17px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Component selection</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">The model names components from your registry. A name outside it cannot be rendered at all.</p></div></li>
        <li class="flex gap-5 border-t border-navy-100 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#5a9100]">04</span><div><p class="text-[17px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Prop validation</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Every prop is checked against a schema first. Invalid props fail closed and fall back to text.</p></div></li>
        <li class="flex gap-5 border-t border-navy-100 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#5a9100]">05</span><div><p class="text-[17px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Streamed render, action in place</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Components stream in as they resolve, and the controls are real: adjust, correct, approve, export.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] bg-[#0b1115]" style="box-shadow: 0 40px 60px -30px rgba(15,23,42,.55);">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-3.5">
          <span class="mr-auto font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/45">What the model returns</span>
          <button type="button" @click="pick('valid')" class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors" :class="o === 'valid' ? 'border-[#9bd600] bg-[#76B900]/20 text-[#9bd600]' : 'border-white/15 text-white/60 hover:text-white'">Valid<template x-if="o === 'valid' && counting"><span class="tabfill absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[2px] bg-white/70" style="animation-duration: 2s"></span></template></button>
          <button type="button" @click="pick('unknown')" class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors" :class="o === 'unknown' ? 'border-red-400 bg-red-500/15 text-red-300' : 'border-white/15 text-white/60 hover:text-white'">Unknown component<template x-if="o === 'unknown' && counting"><span class="tabfill absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[2px] bg-white/70" style="animation-duration: 2s"></span></template></button>
          <button type="button" @click="pick('props')" class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors" :class="o === 'props' ? 'border-red-400 bg-red-500/15 text-red-300' : 'border-white/15 text-white/60 hover:text-white'">Invalid props<template x-if="o === 'props' && counting"><span class="tabfill absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[2px] bg-white/70" style="animation-duration: 2s"></span></template></button>
        </div>
        <pre class="m-0 overflow-x-auto px-5 py-5 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/80" aria-label="Example model output"><code x-show="o === 'valid'">[
  { <span class="text-sky-300">"component"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"KpiRow"</span>,
    <span class="text-sky-300">"props"</span>: { <span class="text-sky-300">"range"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"7d"</span>, <span class="text-sky-300">"metrics"</span>: [<span class="text-[#9bd600]">"revenue"</span>, <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"orders"</span>] } },
  { <span class="text-sky-300">"component"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"BarChart"</span>,
    <span class="text-sky-300">"props"</span>: { <span class="text-sky-300">"by"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"channel"</span>, <span class="text-sky-300">"range"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"7d"</span> } }
]</code><code x-show="o === 'unknown'" style="display:none">[
  { <span class="text-sky-300">"component"</span>: <span class="text-red-300">"FullScreenPopup"</span>,
    <span class="text-sky-300">"props"</span>: { <span class="text-sky-300">"message"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"Buy now!"</span> } }
]</code><code x-show="o === 'props'" style="display:none">[
  { <span class="text-sky-300">"component"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"BarChart"</span>,
    <span class="text-sky-300">"props"</span>: { <span class="text-sky-300">"by"</span>: <span class="text-[#9bd600]">"channel"</span>, <span class="text-sky-300">"range"</span>: <span class="text-red-300">"forever"</span> } }
]</code></pre>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 px-5 py-5">
          <div x-show="o === 'valid'">
            <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]"></span>Accepted: both components are in the registry and the props pass the schema</p>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-4">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><div class="rounded-lg border border-navy-100 p-2.5"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Revenue</p><p class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-[#111827]">&hellip;</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-navy-100 p-2.5"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Orders</p><p class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-[#111827]">&hellip;</p></div></div>
              <div class="mt-3 space-y-1.5"><div class="h-2.5 w-[88%] rounded-full" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg,#9bd600,#76B900)"></div><div class="h-2.5 w-[52%] rounded-full" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg,#9bd600,#76B900)"></div><div class="h-2.5 w-[30%] rounded-full" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg,#9bd600,#76B900)"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div x-show="o === 'unknown'" style="display:none">
            <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-red-300"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>Rejected: &ldquo;FullScreenPopup&rdquo; is not in your registry, so nothing renders</p>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.07] p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/75"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Fallback</span><br>The user gets a plain text answer instead. Your design system is untouched.</div>
          </div>
          <div x-show="o === 'props'" style="display:none">
            <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-red-300"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>Rejected: &ldquo;range&rdquo; must be one of 7d, 30d, 90d</p>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.07] p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/75"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Fallback</span><br>Invalid props fail closed. The worst case is a plain answer, never a broken screen.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-center font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Illustrative example. It cycles every 2 seconds; click a tab to hold one.</p>
